author: "harness:claude-code"
estimated_minutes: 360
acceptance_criteria: "One installed-package listing takes --depth brief|standard|deep, where brief reads only manifests and saved state, standard adds the runtime activation probe, and deep adds the live registry check; The SDK list target, the CLI list subcommand and the MCP package tool resolve to the same listing; explore and manage keep working as compatibility spellings with unchanged output"
parent: pm-ugqx
